	(text "STM32U595RJT6 (LQFP64, pin-identical to U595RITx symbol). USB OTG HS with internal PHY on PA11/PA12 -> 8 kHz polling.\nHSE 16 MHz (valid USB HS PHY reference). VDDA filtered by FB1. ADC1/ADC2 read MUX_OUT1..8 (PA0-PA7).\nSPI3 master to nRF52840 radio (NRF_CS/SCK/MISO/MOSI) + NRF_IRQ data-ready + NRF_RST_N.\nLED data: SPI2_MOSI (PB15) -> SN74LV1T125 level shifter (powered from LED_5V) -> 33R -> first LED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
